+# TLS Certificate Verification
+
+The project's current recorded decision is that TLS certificate verification stays enabled on all builds, including development builds; it is not disabled in development environments for local testing. This is consistent with the separate, more recent decision to enforce HTTPS everywhere with no plaintext exception for any service.
